# .claude/ is personal, local Claude Code state and is NOT committed — drop your
# own private skills in .claude/skills/ and they stay local. Team skills live in
# the committed top-level skills/ directory; each is exposed to Claude Code's
# discovery by a committed symlink under .claude/skills/ (-> ../../skills/<name>).
# Tracked exceptions: the deny-policy settings and those per-skill symlinks.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
# Shared-skill symlinks. Add a line here when you share a new skill:
!.claude/skills/analyze-logs
!.claude/skills/safe-logging

